dogecoin.text:
@xtdisnkfe @magicalcrypto @Excellion Why is loafwallet named loafwallet? 

Basically someone on /r/Litecoin said since the bitcoin iOS wallet was called breadwallet, dogecoin wallet doughwallet, we should call the litecoin app loafwallet.

Keeping the bread theme + starting with L for litecoin.
